      "text": "Configure a backup window for the RDS DB instances for daily snapshots. Assign a snapshot retention policy of 7 years to each RDS DB instance. Use Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager (Amazon DLM) to schedule snapshot deletions",
      "correct": false,
      "selected": false
    },
